{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14329","headline":"岁晚喜远兄弟至书情 · 窦巩","name":"岁晚喜远兄弟至书情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几年沧海别，相见竟多违。\n鬓发缘愁白，音书爲嬾稀。\n新诗徒有赠，故国未同归。\n人事那堪问，无言是与非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦巩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}